239
00:17:59,300 --> 00:18:02,260
And they just looked like they had been up all night and turns out that they had been

240
00:18:02,260 --> 00:18:07,399
because they were looking for Larry, even though he was asleep in his tent.

241
00:18:07,480 --> 00:18:12,080
So they kind of got what they deserved, didn't they?

242
00:18:12,080 --> 00:18:16,840
So thanks, Larry, for lending a little bit of comic relief to a sobering subject.

243
