This isn't all that difficult, is it, folks?

244
00:18:21,659 --> 00:18:24,699
I mean, what you're going to do is you're going to make sure there's no hazing going on.

245
00:18:25,340 --> 00:18:28,520
You're going to make sure there are no initiations in your troop.

246
00:18:29,139 --> 00:18:35,320
You're going to make sure that there are no mean, humiliating, practical jokes, things like that.

247
00:18:35,320 --> 00:18:42,639
Their rite of passage in scouting is not getting tricked, not getting humiliated.

248
00:18:43,399 --> 00:18:48,540
The rite of passage is a good warm handshake with all your fellow scouts

249
00:18:48,540 --> 00:18:54,879
